            },
            {
                "drawing_id": "a9ecfee2-bab1-4773-b2f8-d606cff8cd1f",
                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"143\" height=\"27\"><rect width=\"143\" height=\"27\" fill=\"#aaffff\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"#000000\" /></svg>",
                "x": 252,
                "y": -391,
                "z": 1
            },
            {
                "drawing_id": "2e165a6a-933a-4f53-8ec7-2d1d7dba7651",
                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"324\" height=\"222\"><text font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">\ud83d\udd39 R1#show ip policy\nInterface      Route map\nFa0/0          PBR\n\ud83d\udd39 R1#show route-map\nroute-map PBR, permit, sequence 10\n  Match clauses:\n    ip address (access-lists): 10\n  Set clauses:\n    ip next-hop 10.0.0.2\n  Policy routing matches: 20 packets, 1960 bytes\n\ud83d\udd39 R1#show access-lists\nStandard IP access list 10\n    10 permit 192.168.1.10 (27 matches)</text></svg>",
                "x": -368,
                "y": -462,
                "z": 2
            },
            {
                "drawing_id": "3ab8f825-7805-417f-9130-e9a9210489fe",
                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"406\" height=\"156\"><text font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">\ud83d\udd39 R1#show ip route rip\n     1.0.0.0/32 is subnetted, 1 subnets\nR       1.1.1.1 [120/1] via 20.0.0.2, 00:00:08, FastEthernet1/0\n     8.0.0.0/32 is subnetted, 1 subnets\nR       8.8.8.8 [120/1] via 10.0.0.2, 00:00:18, FastEthernet0/1\n\n\ud83d\udd39 R3#show ip prefix-list\nip prefix-list ALLOW-ONLY-GOOGLE: 1 entries\n   seq 5 permit 8.8.8.8/32</text></svg>",
                "x": -446,
                "y": -230,
                "z": 2
            },
            {
                "drawing_id": "85aa8884-d5fe-432e-ba13-f4477551465e",
                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"325\" height=\"224\"><rect width=\"325\" height=\"224\" fill=\"#aaff7f\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"#000000\" /></svg>",
                "x": -368,
                "y": -462,
                "z": 1
            },
            {
                "drawing_id": "68c29d4f-0939-4dd2-b811-14c2dbc813cd",
                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"407\" height=\"157\"><rect width=\"407\" height=\"157\" fill=\"#aaff7f\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"#000000\" /></svg>",
                "x": -447,
                "y": -231,
                "z": 1
            },
            {
                "drawing_id": "34153495-750d-4046-9942-69a87d6ba62b",
                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"346\" height=\"80\"><text font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">\u2714\ufe0f PBR applied on R1 using ACL + route-map. \n\u2714\ufe0f ACL matches traffic from PC1 (192.168.1.10).\n\u2714\ufe0f Route-map sends matched traffic to R2 (ISP1).\n\u2714\ufe0f Prefix-list on R3 blocks 1.1.1.1 from RIP updates. </text></svg>",
                "x": -629,
                "y": -27,
                "z": 2
            },
            {
                "drawing_id": "8e5de824-6b2f-4ad8-91bb-842318ef22be",
                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"231\" height=\"62\"><text font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">\u2705 ping 192.168.1.1 (R1): Success\n\u2705 ping 8.8.8.8 (via R2): Success\n\u274c ping 1.1.1.1 (via R3): Fails </text></svg>",
                "x": -272,
                "y": -14,
                "z": 2
